# Custom commands run after the standard updates.
# One command per line. Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.

# Do not run `pi update` commands here. The npm global package step already updates
# the pi CLI, and `pi update --extensions` can block this script inside pi's own
# package manager while producing no visible output.
# Run this manually when needed instead:
# pi update --extensions

